abstract: >-
  Scripts and taxonomy files that extend the MGnify mouse-gut Kraken2/Bracken
  database v1.0 with a custom Mus musculus taxonomy node (taxid 3734) and the
  GRCm39 reference genome, producing database v1.1.
keywords:
  - Kraken2
  - Bracken
  - metagenomics
  - host taxonomy
  - mouse gut microbiome
